    <node id="User">
      <data key="d0">User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">User is an individual interested in kitchen tools and utensils and engages in food preparation or cooking activities.&lt;SEP&gt;User is an individual with a strong interest in visual content, particularly in toys, mechanical pieces, and robotics. This interest is evident from the details of their workspace and the images they are drawn to, which often include various mechanical or robotic objects. User engages attentively with scenes, exhibiting a keen eye for detail, especially concerning the arrangement and manipulation of objects. Their fascination with robotics indicates potential involvement in projects related to robotic assembly or manipulation, further emphasizing their passion for mechanical innovation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd9709f69b32d1da331a945b8c829af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6caa640db9f0cdf9ae711ebf96f8f696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2accd17993f35419e51f645c32b030b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f769320a2af7ac4a44ea65e2235458fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb03b6571310f209acec07571d08186</data>
